                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Chapter 5 pools macro-level data from different sources. Data on trade openness, services sector employment, education, and financial development are sourced from the World Development Indicators Database of the World Bank.  Also, the original data series used to construct the digital infrastructure composite index (which is our preferred measure of digital infrastructure) are all sourced from the database of the World Development Indicators."
